      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIND THE SUN (8) shapes nicely here coming off an excellent 22.02 success at Ballarat over 390m. Hard to top on the time from last start. INGA JOHNNY (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (22.75) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here sound including nine wins. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from five starts. Key runner on best form. BLACKPOOL FINN (2) drew the inside and won last time at Geelong over 400m (22.52), scoring by 0.9 lengths. Leading player again. BUSH MAYHEM (5) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
